# Local cleanup archives (not substrate)
*-cleanup.zip

# Owner-brand profile: personal brand identity, deliberately local-only.
# This repo is public; the owner's brand guide, voice rules, and tokens are not.
# Files remain on disk and the OTLC-Design skill reads them in internal mode.
# Back this directory up separately: it is NOT recoverable from git history.
# See owner-brand/README.md (the only tracked file in here) for the expected shape.
owner-brand/*
!owner-brand/README.md
